    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19113" root="سحق" body-key="s">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انسحق</span></b>  [<i>It was,</i> or <i>became, bruised, brayed,</i>
or <i>pounded:</i> &amp;c.:] quasi-pass. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحَقَهُ</span> as expl.
in the first sentence of this art. (S, O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Said of a garment, <i>It was,</i> or <i>became,</i> [<i>worn out;</i>
or <i>thin and worn out;</i> (see 1;) or] <i>threadbare,</i>
or <i>napless, while new.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And [said of a
place,] <i>It was wide,</i> or <i>ample.</i> (O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See
also 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انسحق الدَّمْعُ</span> <i>The tears were shed.</i>
(TA.)

